  "This tiny control station allows access to the massive memory banks of the station's computer. Ever since the formation of the Third Galactic Union ended the great interstellar dark age, every Stellar Patrol spaceship, every Patrol space station, has been equipped with a computer bulging with the entire accumulated knowledge of mankind. Never again will humanity be permitted to slip back into the ignorance and savagery of the dark age.\n   A ladder leads up to Level Eight, and there's a call button next to the elevator shaft to the north.",
  "There is gravity here at the bottom of the elevator shaft. The elevator's not in sight; the only exit is back to the computer room to the south.",
